            <div id="topnews">
                <div class="icon"><img src="/bundles/templating/images/top_news/important.png"></div>
                <div class="body">
                    <h1 style="font-size: 11pt;">Showers and Thunderstorms from the Southern Plains into the Mid-Mississippi Valley; Record Warmth in the Plains and Midwest</h1>
                    <p>
                        Heavy rain and widely scattered severe storms capable of large hail, damaging winds, and possibly a tornado are expected over portions of the central and southern Plains into the Lower Missouri Valley. Unseasonable warmth will continue for a few more days across the Midwest and Southeast where several daily record highs could fall.
                                                                            <a href="http://www.wpc.ncep.noaa.gov/discussions/hpcdiscussions.php?disc=pmdspd" target="_blank">Read More &gt;</a>
                                            </p>
                </div>
